   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.7 Random Forest Regression\n",
    "\n",
    "Random Forest Regression combines predictions from multiple decision trees. Each tree is trained using random subsets of the data and features, and their predictions are aggregated to produce the final prediction. This can provide a more robust model than a single decision tree."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 96,
   "id": "f242b7b9-8de2-40bb-8a6b-3d1aa14ad746",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
