   "source": [
    "### 4.8 Gradient Boosting Regression\n",
    "\n",
    "Gradient Boosting Regression builds an ensemble of weak learners sequentially. Each new learner attempts to reduce the errors made by the previous learners, allowing the model to capture nonlinear relationships in the data."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 99,
   "id": "a78d244e-6a8d-438f-8b4c-ebb710f0b976",
