   "source": [
    "### 4.13 Hyperparameter Tuning — Ridge Regression\n",
    "\n",
    "GridSearchCV is used to tune the regularization parameter `alpha` of Ridge Regression. Five-fold cross-validation is performed using the training data, and the tuned model is subsequently evaluated on the held-out test set."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
